From 91a3ddc257c861cc3fd705058fcf4091fdd37cd2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yasoteien <263659156+yasoteien@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:28:28 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 44/46] pomera_dm250: SPDX and copyright lines

Our new files get the copyright line (the C files already had SPDX);
the config fragments, Kconfig and mklogo.py get both. The DTS is
GPL-2.0+ like rk3128.dtsi, with the Rockchip 2017 line for the parts
that come from it. Comments only: the DTB and u-boot.bin do not change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: yasoteien <263659156+yasoteien@users.noreply.github.com>
